{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"aa1b925988838e1371bb072e339379f03dcec5f83d41111f9f14f58e31d5e89e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["圣殿附近的两座屋子"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["他带我出来向北，到外院，又带我进入圣屋；这圣屋一排顺着空地，一排与北边铺石地之屋相对。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这圣屋长一百肘，宽五十肘，有向北的门。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["对着内院那二十肘宽之空地，又对着外院的铺石地，在第三层楼上有楼廊对着楼廊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["在圣屋前有一条夹道，宽十肘，长一百肘。房门都向北。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["圣屋因为楼廊占去些地方，所以上层比中下两层窄些。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["圣屋有三层，却无柱子，不像外院的屋子有柱子；所以上层比中下两层更窄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["圣屋外，东边有墙，靠着外院，长五十肘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["靠着外院的圣屋长五十肘。殿北面的圣屋长一百肘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["在圣屋以下，东头有进入之处，就是从外院进入之处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["向南",{"noteId":46},"在内院墙里有圣屋，一排与铺石地之屋相对，一排顺着空地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["这圣屋前的夹道与北边圣屋的夹道长宽一样；出入之处与北屋门的样式相同。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["正在墙前、夹道的东头，有门可以进入，与向南圣屋的门一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他对我说：「顺着空地的南屋北屋，都是圣屋；亲近耶和华的祭司当在那里吃至圣的物，也当在那里放至圣的物，就是素祭、赎罪祭，和赎愆祭，因此处为圣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["祭司进去出了圣所的时候，不可直到外院，但要在圣屋放下他们供职的衣服，因为是圣衣；要穿上别的衣服才可以到属民的外院。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["圣殿周围的尺寸"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["他量完了内殿，就带我出朝东的门，量院的四围。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他用量度的竿量四围，量东面五百肘",{"noteId":47},"，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["用竿量北面五百肘，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["用竿量南面五百肘，"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["又转到西面，用竿量五百肘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["他量四面，四围有墙，长五百肘，宽五百肘，为要分别圣地与俗地。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":46,"caller":"-","text":"原文是东","reference":{"chapter":42,"verse":10}},{"noteId":47,"caller":"-","text":"原文是竿；本章下同","reference":{"chapter":42,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/43.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}